      "be1292777342_html": "Facturé 347,40 $ tous les 3 ans",
      "be2009563225_html": "Économisez 72%",
      "be134330248225_html": "<b>Tous les plans incluent :</b>",
      "be401961393_html": "Suivi GPS en temps réel",
      "be501473132_html": "Alertes &amp; Limites",
      "be741411229_html": "Historique des itinéraires",
      "be917724140258_html": "<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / var(--tw-bg-opacity, 1)); font-size: var(--p-font-size-100); color: var(--p-color-text); font-family: var(--p-font-family-sans); font-weight: var(--p-font-weight-regular);\">Alertes Anti-Vol</span></div>",
      "be1636352841_html": "Accès mobile et web",
